{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0156QtouYCkdWSB3rgnoUsuR","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_6/projects/faith-evidence-ie/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# faith-evidence-ie — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-15 13:42 UTC | 更新原因: Reviewer 路线图审查修正：GPU 表更新实际状态、joint evi_f1 进展、DPO 升 P0、C2 风险标注\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nFREIGE: LLM-based evidence-grounded DocRE 新任务范式。核心发现：GRPO 在结构化 IE 上导致 evidence-extraction decoupling。RSFT+NLI-based scoring 有效提升证据质量。CED 作为 scoring function 之一，显著性待验证。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research（MVP 2026-05-15 通过）\\\\n- **Dream v1**: best=2.5, median=3.0, worst=2.5 → 不达标\\\\n- **Reframe 完成** (D044): CED 降级、claims 重构（C1=可行性, C2=decoupling, C3=NLI ablation, C4=EDCR）\\\\n- **Re-dream**: dream_20260515T132059 运行中，验证 reframe 效果（目标 best≥3.5, median≥3.0）\\\\n- **MVP 成果**: RSFT 4/4 configs PASS (rel_f1 +3.9~6.0pp vs SFT)；joint evi_f1 已回填（SFT=0.3117 → best RSFT s44=0.3713, +5.96pp）\\\\n- **GRPO 判死**: 3 reward × 多 lr 全线 catastrophic forgetting (D031/D033)\\\\n- **topk3 scoring 完成**: 8037 samples (2.96x topk1)，数据就绪\\\\n- **DPO 升级为 P0** (D045): 直接影响 C2 decoupling 叙事\\\\n\\\\n## 投稿目标\\\\n- Primary: **EMNLP 2026 Main** (ARR July cycle, ~July 15-25)\\\\n- Fallback: AAAI 2027 (abstract July 25, paper Aug 1)\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] 等 re-dream 结果验证 reframe\\\\n- [ ] Agent 处理队列（urgent: s43_r2 registry 修复 + plan_008 双变体设计 + evaluate() joint 集成）\\\\n- [ ] Re-dream 达标后批准 P0 实验：\\\\n  - plan_011: GRPO G=8（**最高风险，首批启动**，C2 必要条件）\\\\n  - plan_001: flat-NLI RSFT ablation (C3)\\\\n  - plan_004: DREEAM baseline reproduction (C1)\\\\n  - plan_012: DPO+CED（**升 P0**，C2 叙事关键）\\\\n- [ ] 处理运行中实验结果（maxtok1536_r2 cuda:1, CED reranker cuda:0）\\\\n- [ ] plan_008 topk3 双变体训练（cuda:2 全量 / cuda:3 过滤CED=0）\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 分配\\\\n\\\\n| GPU | 状态 | 任务 |\\\\n|-----|------|------|\\\\n| cuda:0 | 🏃 | mvp2_ced_reranker_poc (plan_005) |\\\\n| cuda:1 | 🏃 | mvp2_eval_rsft_r2b_maxtok1536_r2 |\\\\n| cuda:2 | ⏳ | 待分配 → plan_008 topk3_all |\\\\n| cuda:3 | ⏳ | 待分配 → plan_008 topk3_ced_filtered |\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 硬件: 4× RTX 5090 32GB (rtx5090-4x)\\\\n- MVP 已消耗: ~80+ GPU-hours\\\\n- Research P0: ~75h (flat-NLI 25h + CED seeds 10h + test eval 4h + DREEAM 8h + GRPO G=8 16h + DPO 12h)\\\\n- Research P1: ~46h (EDCR人工验证 API + post-hoc 4h + reranker 6h + model size 24h + Re-DocRED 12h)\\\\n\\\\n## 评审笔记\\\\n1. ✅ CED 重框定（paper_framing.md 已更新）\\\\n2. ✅ EDCR 升格为独立贡献 (Claim 4)\\\\n3. ✅ NLI lexical overlap bias 验证\\\\n4. ✅ Joint evi_f1 已回填（paper_framing.md 表格已更新）\\\\n5. ✅ DPO 定位修正（纯 offline，非 online/offline 中间点）\\\\n6. ⬜ Baselines 扩展到 12+ (含 DPO, GRPO G=8, post-hoc retrieval)\\\\n\\\\n## 风险监控\\\\n- **C2 单点依赖**: GRPO G=8 是 publishability 必要条件。若 G=8 下 decoupling 不复现 → scope 大幅缩减。G=8 必须是 re-dream 后首批 P0。\\\\n- **CED=0 稀释**: topk3 数据含 ced_reward=0 样本，双变体实验区分数据量效应 vs 信号稀释。\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D046 | 2026-05-15 | D045: DPO 从 P1 升 P0 + GRPO G=8 定为 re-dream 后首批实验 + | plan_012, plan_011, plan_008 |\\\\n| D045 | 2026-05-15 | D045: DPO 升级 P0 + GRPO G=8 排为第一优先；DPO 定位修正为 offlin | plan_012, plan_011 |\\\\n| D044 | 2026-05-15 | Dream v1 分析完成：reframe paper_framing.md，CED 降级，clai | plan_011, plan_012, plan_013 |\\\\n| D043 | 2026-05-15 | D042: Dream 审稿分析——best=2.5/median=3.0/worst=2.5（评分 | — |\\\\n| D042 | 2026-05-15 | D041: Evi-F1 评测协议与 DREEAM 不一致——我们的 conditional Evi | mvp2_sft_eval_r2, mvp2_eval_rsft_r1, mvp2_eval_rsft_r2a, mvp2_eval_rsft_r2b |\\\\n| D041 | 2026-05-15 | D041: Evi-F1 评测协议不一致确认——我们的\\\\\\\"条件 Evi-F1\\\\\\\"(仅 TP triple | mvp2_sft_eval_r2, mvp2_eval_rsft_r1, mvp2_eval_rsft_r2a, mvp2_eval_rsft_r2b |\\\\n| D040 | 2026-05-15 | D040: MVP 正式通过 → 进入 Research 阶段。paper_framing.md 定 | mvp2_eval_rsft_r2a, mvp2_eval_rsft_r2b, mvp2_eval_rsft_r1, mvp2_rsft_train_r1_s44 |\\\\n| D039 | 2026-05-15 | D039: RSFT+CED ablation 全部 PASS MVP-2——方法鲁棒，1 epoc | mvp2_eval_rsft_r2a, mvp2_eval_rsft_r2b, mvp2_eval_rsft_r1, mvp2_rsft_train_r1_s44 |\\\\n| D038 | 2026-05-15 | D038: 撤回 D037——RSFT \\\\\\\"灾难性失败\\\\\\\"实为 eval bug（50-doc pred | mvp2_rsft_train_r1_s44, mvp2_rsft_train_r1 |\\\\n| D037 | 2026-05-15 | D037: RSFT 全线 FAIL（rel_f1=0.0483），pivot 到 CED-as-r | mvp2_rsft_train_r1, mvp2_rsft_train_r1_s43, mvp2_rsft_train_r1_s44 |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3772, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01W9UqwyL8aJV3AUpwvgEPBC","session_id":"6f25cfed-835a-4517-9646-6292208db176","uuid":"f3541364-54fe-4a9e-a6d2-c8ba4648aac2","timestamp":"2026-05-15T14:10:24.964Z"}
